		</TRID_INFO>
		<TRIO_INFO>
			<TRAN name="obtrf_oder_405r" title="파생상품 계좌별 예약주문내역" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="168" _ulen="124" >

ADOD_DATE^예약주문 일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNT_PWD^계좌 비밀번호^68^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="30" inout="out" _len="709" _ulen="531" >

ADOD_DATE^예약주문 일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
RSEV_ACPT_SRNO^예약 접수 일련번호^11^0^7^0^0^0^0
ISCD^종목코드^12^0^0^0^0^0^0
ISCD_NAME^종목코드 명^40^0^0^0^0^0^0
